        "custom_FxBWfk": {
          "type": "custom",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<details class=\"db-shipping-info\">\n\n  <summary class=\"db-shipping-header\">\n    <span>\n      {% if request.locale.iso_code == 'de' %}\n        Versandinformationen\n      {% else %}\n        Informativa sulle spedizioni\n      {% endif %}\n    </span>\n\n    <svg\n      class=\"db-shipping-arrow\"\n      viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\n    >\n      <path\n        d=\"M6 15l6-6 6 6\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        stroke-width=\"1.7\"\n        stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n        stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n      />\n    </svg>\n  </summary>\n\n  <div class=\"db-shipping-content\">\n    {% if request.locale.iso_code == 'de' %}\n\n      <ul>\n        <li>\n          <strong>Bearbeitungszeit:</strong>\n          Deine Bestellung wird in der Regel innerhalb von\n          1–2 Werktagen vorbereitet, verpackt und an den\n          Versanddienstleister übergeben.\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <strong>Transportzeit:</strong>\n          Nach dem Versand benötigt das Paket normalerweise\n          3 bis 7 Werktage, um sein Ziel zu erreichen.\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <strong>Gesamte Lieferzeit:</strong>\n          In den meisten Fällen erhältst du deine Bestellung\n          innerhalb von insgesamt 4 bis 9 Werktagen.\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n\n    {% else %}\n\n      <ul>\n        <li>\n          <strong>Tempo di elaborazione:</strong>\n          I tuoi ordini vengono preparati, imballati e affidati\n          al corriere solitamente in 1–2 giorni lavorativi.\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <strong>Tempo di transito:</strong>\n          Una volta spedito, il pacco impiega normalmente\n          dai 3 ai 7 giorni lavorativi per raggiungere la tua\n          destinazione.\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <strong>Tempo di consegna totale:</strong>\n          Nella maggior parte dei casi, riceverai il tuo acquisto\n          entro un arco di tempo compreso tra 4 e 9 giorni\n          lavorativi complessivi.\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n\n    {% endif %}\n  </div>\n\n</details>\n\n<style>\n  .db-shipping-info {\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 12px 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.22);\n    border-radius: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-header {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    min-height: 52px;\n    padding: 12px 48px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n\n    /* Lichtgrijze achtergrond */\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    color: #111111;\n\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-header::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-header::marker {\n    display: none;\n    content: \"\";\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-arrow {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 15px;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 17px;\n    transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  }\n\n  /* Pijl naar beneden wanneer het vak gesloten is */\n  .db-shipping-info:not([open]) .db-shipping-arrow {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-content {\n    padding: 17px 22px 18px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n\n    /* Uitgeklapte vak blijft wit */\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.14);\n\n    color: #252525;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-content ul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-content li {\n    margin: 0 0 5px;\n    padding-left: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-content li:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .db-shipping-content strong {\n    color: #111111;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* Mobiele weergave */\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .db-shipping-info {\n      margin: 10px 0;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .db-shipping-header {\n      min-height: 49px;\n      padding: 11px 42px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    }\n\n    .db-shipping-arrow {\n      right: 13px;\n      width: 16px;\n      height: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .db-shipping-content {\n      padding: 15px 15px 16px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .db-shipping-content ul {\n      padding-left: 19px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
